#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trademasters"
msgstr "Handelsmeesters"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginians were broadly known for their extensive trade over the "
"Mediterranean Sea."
msgstr "De Carthagers stonden alom bekend wegens hun uitgebreide handel rondom de Middellandse Zee."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Trade ships are available in the Village Phase."
msgstr "Handelsschepen zijn beschikbaar in de Dorpsfase."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Mining Economy"
msgstr "Mijnbouweconomie"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Carthaginian economy was centered around mining, with stone comprising "
"much of Carthage's structures."
msgstr "De Carthaagse economie was georganiseerd rond de mijnbouw, met steen als voornaamste materiaal van Carthaagse gebouwen."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Stone mining technologies are free and instant."
msgstr "Mijnbouwtechnologieën van steen zijn gratis en direct beschikbaar."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Numidian Cavalry"
msgstr "Numidische cavalerie"

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid ""
"The Numidian cavalry's horses, ancestors of the Berber horse, were small "
"compared with other horses of the era, and were well adapted for faster "
"movement over long distances."
msgstr "De paarden van de Numidische cavalerie, voorouders van het Berber paard, waren klein vergeleken met andere paarden uit die tijd, en waren zeer geschikt voor hoge snelheid over lange afstanden."

#: simulation/data/civs/cart.json
msgid "Cavalry Javelineers +10% walk speed."
msgstr "Cavalerie Speerwerpers +10% loopsnelheid."

